        "created_at": "2015-06-02T02:30:36.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Rabit\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/rabit/48/5774_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Rabit:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div><b>Donner wrote:</b><br><blockquote>Naturally.\n&nbsp;\n</blockquote></div>\nSo I pick up the ball and I throw it to Naturally.\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>No, you throw it to Who.</p>\n<p>(I introduced my kids to the baseball bit last summer. The Munchkin, current age 5, still doesn't quite follow all of it, but the Grasshopper, current age 9, got a kick out of it once he paid enough attention to actually follow what was going on.)</p>",
